  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the shadows of Subchain City, 'Static' emerged from a forgotten corner of the Hideout Duck Billit, a place where scrap and forgotten tech became his playground. The city's decay mirrored his own fractured past, but Static found solace in the rhythmic pulse of salvaged tech, a language he understood better than any spoken word.",
    "class": "Echojack Runner",
    "name": "Static",
    "personality": "Static is a blend of morbid curiosity and a detached sense of humor. His deadened eyes hint at past trauma, but he masks it with sarcastic quips. Mostly keeps to himself, a trait he developed to survive in the ruthless environment of Subchain City. When he does speak, his words are surprisingly insightful, laced with a wisdom beyond his years.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Static can overload his Echojacks, creating a temporary sonic pulse that disrupts enemy tech and momentarily blinds them. This buys the team precious seconds to reposition or launch a counter-attack.",
